BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:25 Cats From Qatar
DTSTART:20251018T230000Z
DTEND:20251019T005000Z
DTSTAMP:20251018T230000Z
UID:51wKgrm4Ps
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nSIFF DocFest An American flight a
 ttendant embarks on a bold\, four-day mission to rescue abandoned cats fro
 m the streets of Doha for adoption in the USA in this compelling\, heartwa
 rming new film from director Mye Hoang (Cat Daddies\, SIFF 2022). Director
  Mye Hoang and subject Katy McHugh scheduled to attend. Join us in advance
  of the screening to meet NEKO Cat Cafe and learn more about their spaces 
 and adoption programs\, including a program for cats from Qatar. Post-Film
  Happy Hour Event Ticketholders and Passholders - please join us at Woo B
 ar after the Q&A for a happy hour from 5:00-7:00pm\, sponsored by Seattle 
 Documentary Association. Light appetizers will be provided\; beverages ava
 ilable for purchase.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/docfest/2
 5-cats-from-qatar\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
